    </ul>
    <h3>BBER Methodology</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>– Starts at <span data-field="bber_start">{{ bber_start }}</span> 2014, incrementally increases year-by-year to maximum of <span data-field="bber_max">{{ bber_max }}</span> in 2020</li>
      <li>Take up function of marketing</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Other Modeling Assumptions for Cost</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Medicaid population grows at <span data-field="pop_growth_rate">{{ pop_growth_rate }}</span> annually</li>
    <li>Traditional and Expansion FMAP's split per FY</li>
    <li>PMPY Costs highly variable by subpopulation
      <ul>
        <li><span data-field="uninsured_childless">{{ uninsured_childless }}</span> uninsured are childless adults</li>
        <li><span data-field="fair_poor_health_pct">{{ fair_poor_health_pct }}</span> report fair to poor health</li>
