      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>PMPY costs escalate per CPI-medical care (<span data-field="cpi_escalation">{{ cpi_escalation }}</span>)</li>
    <li>Administrative costs estimated at <span data-field="admin_cost_pct">{{ admin_cost_pct }}</span> total cost
      <ul>
        <li>– Mathematica Policy Institute</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

