                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Costs, however, are incurred in the early years
                <ul class="bullet-list">
                    <li>Wood work population will enroll in traditional Medicaid and is subject to annually adjusted Federal Medical Assistance Percentage (<span data-field="fmap_percentage_federal">{{ fmap_percentage_federal }}</span> federal, <span data-field="fmap_percentage_state">{{ fmap_percentage_state }}</span> state)</li>
                    <li>State will incur administrative expenses</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
